# Bot1 casts Memory Jar with five Moxen and sacrifices it: both hands are exiled and replaced by seven new cards. At the
# end step each player discards the new hand and gets the exiled cards back.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Memory Jar
Mountain
Swamp x7

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Forest x7

